> ronary*" "*heart*surgery*" "*heart*operation*" "*surgery*heart*" "*operation*heart*" "*artery*surgery*" "*artery*operation*" "*surgery*artery*" "*operation*artery*" "*coronar
> y*artery*bypass*" "*cabg*" "*coronary*graft*" "*cardiac*stent*" "*angioplasty*" "*coronary*intervention*" "*endarterectomy*" "*carotid*artery*stent*" "

